# {{.ProjectName}} - AWS Lambda Event Processing

A production-grade AWS Lambda function built with Go for comprehensive event processing from multiple AWS sources including SQS, SNS, EventBridge, DynamoDB Streams, and Kinesis.

## 🏗️ Architecture

This Lambda function implements advanced event-driven patterns with:

- **Multi-Source Event Processing**: Handles {{range $i, $source := .EventSources}}{{if $i}}, {{end}}{{$source}}{{end}}
- **{{.ProcessingPattern | title}} Processing**: Optimized for {{.ProcessingPattern}} event processing patterns
- **Comprehensive Observability**: X-Ray tracing, CloudWatch metrics, structured logging
- **Production Resilience**: {{range $i, $feature := .ResilienceFeatures}}{{if $i}}, {{end}}{{$feature}}{{end}}
- **Enterprise Security**: {{range $i, $feature := .SecurityFeatures}}{{if $i}}, {{end}}{{$feature}}{{end}}

## 🚀 Features

### Event Sources
{{- range .EventSources}}
- **{{. | upper}}**: Production-ready {{.}} event processing with error handling
