### Processing Patterns
- **{{.ProcessingPattern | title}}**: Optimized {{.ProcessingPattern}} processing with configurable concurrency
- **Intelligent Routing**: Automatic event type detection and routing to appropriate handlers
- **Error Isolation**: Individual message failures don't affect batch processing

### Observability & Monitoring
- **Structured Logging**: {{.LoggerType}} with correlation IDs and trace integration
